        {
          "type": "標題",
          "html": "<grammarly-extension data-grammarly-shadow-root=\"true\" style=\"visibility: visible !important; position: absolute; top: 0px; left: -2.97619px; pointer-events: none; --rem: 16;\" class=\"dnXmp\"></grammarly-extension><grammarly-extension data-grammarly-shadow-root=\"true\" style=\"visibility: visible !important; position: absolute; top: 0px; left: -2.97619px; pointer-events: none; --rem: 16;\" class=\"dnXmp\"></grammarly-extension><div class=\"eb-block-drag\" title=\"拖曳移動區塊\">⠿</div>\n        <div class=\"eb-ctrl\">\n          <span class=\"eb-ctrl-tag\">標題</span>\n          <button class=\"eb-ctrl-btn\" onclick=\"moveBlock('eb-1',-1,event)\">↑</button>\n          <button class=\"eb-ctrl-btn\" onclick=\"moveBlock('eb-1',1,event)\">↓</button>\n          <button class=\"eb-ctrl-btn del\" onclick=\"deleteBlock('eb-1',event)\">✕</button>\n        </div>\n        <h2 contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-placeholder=\"標題文字\" data-listener-added_369fa667=\"true\" data-zh=\"當你的眼神開始驅動另一張臉\" data-en=\"When Your Gaze Starts Driving Another Face\">當你的眼神開始驅動另一張臉</h2>\n      "
        },
        {
          "type": "文字",
          "html": "<grammarly-extension data-grammarly-shadow-root=\"true\" style=\"visibility: visible !important; position: absolute; top: 0px; left: -2.97619px; pointer-events: none; --rem: 16;\" class=\"dnXmp\"></grammarly-extension><grammarly-extension data-grammarly-shadow-root=\"true\" style=\"visibility: visible !important; position: absolute; top: 0px; left: -2.97619px; pointer-events: none; --rem: 16;\" class=\"dnXmp\"></grammarly-extension><div class=\"eb-block-drag\" title=\"拖曳移動區塊\">⠿</div>\n        <div class=\"eb-ctrl\">\n          <span class=\"eb-ctrl-tag\">文字</span>\n          <button class=\"eb-ctrl-btn\" onclick=\"moveBlock('eb-2',-1,event)\">↑</button>\n          <button class=\"eb-ctrl-btn\" onclick=\"moveBlock('eb-2',1,event)\">↓</button>\n          <button class=\"eb-ctrl-btn del\" onclick=\"deleteBlock('eb-2',event)\">✕</button>\n        </div>\n        <div contenteditable=\"true\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-placeholder=\"輸入段落文字…\" data-listener-added_369fa667=\"true\" data-zh=\"&lt;p&gt;不是鏡子。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;比鏡子更奇怪一點。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;你坐在鏡頭前，偵測器悄悄記錄你每次眨眼、每次視線的漂移。它把你的眼睛折算成數字——EAR 值、凝視向量、頭部在三維空間裡的相對位置——然後把這些數字送進一隻狐狸的身體裡。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;他的眼瞼跟著你開合。他的瞳孔跟著你移動。你向前靠，他的每一層皮膚、每一片透明賽璐璐的景深，都按照遠近獨立縮放，像是一場你從來不知道自己在操控的偶戲。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;這是 Foxguy，一個跑在瀏覽器裡的臉部驅動角色動畫系統。&lt;/p&gt;\" data-en=\"&lt;p&gt;Not a mirror.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A little stranger than a mirror.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You sit in front of the camera, and a detector quietly tracks every blink, every drift of your gaze. It converts your eyes into numbers — EAR values, gaze vectors, the head's relative position in 3D space — then feeds those numbers into the body of a fox.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;His eyelids open and close with yours. His pupils follow your gaze. As you lean closer, every layer of his skin, every sheet of translucent cel depth, scales independently with distance — like a puppet show you never knew you were operating.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is Foxguy, a face-driven character animation system that runs in the browser.&lt;/p&gt;\" data-listener-added_c1ce1dce=\"true\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 24px; letter-spacing: 2.4px;\">不是鏡子。&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 24px; letter-spacing: 2.4px;\">比鏡子更奇怪一點。&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 24px; letter-spacing: 2.4px;\">你坐在鏡頭前，偵測器悄悄記錄你每次眨眼、每次視線的漂移。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 24px; letter-spacing: 2.4px;\">她的眼瞼跟著你開合。她的瞳孔跟著你移動。你向前靠，她的每一層皮膚、每一片透明賽璐璐的景深，都按照遠近獨立縮放，像是一場你從來不知道自己在操控的偶戲。&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 24px; letter-spacing: 2.4px;\">這是 Foxguy，一個跑在瀏覽器裡的臉部驅動角色動畫系統。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 24px; letter-spacing: 2.4px;\">我很難解釋第一次讓它跑起來時的感覺。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 24px; letter-spacing: 2.4px;\">技術上我知道發生了什麼：MediaPipe 在 GPU 上跑，468 個 landmark 每秒刷新 60 次，EAR 的比值觸發眼瞼動畫和 bloom shader 的色溫切換，GLSL 裡的 `uIntensity` uniform 讓每一層視覺效果可以單獨調節強度。</span></p>\n<!-- notionvc: 2df54e38-8c14-4bc0-a97e-e261c95ed309 --></div>\n      "
        },
